OL,3,GNEWSAFour taken to hospital after
OL,4,Achemical alert
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people have been taken to hospital
OL,7,Fafter a hazardous substance alert at a
OL,8,Frecycling centre.
OL,10,FFire crews and a number of ambulances
OL,11,Farrived at the scene on an industrial
OL,12,Festate in Kirkby on Merseyside at about
OL,13,F10:30 GMT.
OL,15,FMerseyside Fire And Rescue Service
OL,16,F(MFRS) said "an unknown chemical linked
OL,17,Fto animal feed" had "caused a dust
OL,18,Fplume to fill the recycling centre".
OL,20,FSuez, the company that runs the site,
OL,21,Fsaid the site was evacuated as a
OL,22,Fprecaution.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
